resource for a founder

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.800
or developer that's looking to
get something off the ground.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.000
NICK ORLOVE: That's cool.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.083
So I know that you're based
out of the West Coast,

00:03:22.083 --> 00:03:24.292
